<title>ESTONIA: HUVITUSFOND TO SET INTEREST PAYMENTS FOR BONDS.</title>
<headline>HUVITUSFOND TO SET INTEREST PAYMENTS FOR BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Huvitusfond (Compensation Fund) said on Monday that it will fix the list of its third series bond holders to get interest payments on May 15.</p>
<p>Huvitusfond third series bonds are traded cum-interest for the last day today, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Huvitusfond will pay an interest of 11.18 percent or 11.18 kroons per bond.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
